{"card":{"card_id":"ma-c-26399dde3dba540abcd5","statement":"h_{1}(v_{ijk}) = h_{ij}^{(1)} v_{ijk},\nh_{2}(v_{ijk}) = h_{ij}^{(2)} v_{ijk},\n\ne_{01}(v_{ijk}) = S^{+}_{ijk} v_{i+1,j,k},\nf_{01}(v_{ijk}) = S^{-}_{ik} v_{i-1,j,k},\n\ne_{10}(v_{ijk}) = S^{-}_{ik} Q^{+}_{j+1,k} v_{i,j+1,k+1}\n+ T^{-}_{j+1,k} Q^{-}_{j+1,k} v_{i,j+1,k},\n\nf_{10}(v_{ijk}) = S^{+}_{ijk} Q^{+}_{j+1,k} v_{i,j-1,k}\n+ T^{+}_{k-1} Q^{-}_{j+1,k} v_{i,j-1,k-1},\n\ne_{11}(v_{ijk}) = - S^{+}_{ijk} Q^{+}_{j+1,k} v_{i+1,j+1,k+1}\n+ T^{-}_{j+1,k} Q^{-}_{j+1,k} v_{i+1,j+1,k},\n\nf_{11}(v_{ijk}) = S^{-}_{i,k} Q^{+}_{j+1,k} v_{i-1,j-1,k}\n- T^{+}_{k-1} Q^{-}_{j+1,k} v_{i-1,j-1,k-1},\n\ne_{21}(v_{ijk}) = 2 T^{-}_{j+1,k} v_{i+1,j+2,k+1},\nf_{21}(v_{ijk}) = 2 T^{+}_{k-1} v_{i-1,j-2,k-1}.","source_id":"arXiv:2402.00483","cluster":"representation_theory","statement_sha256":"fbfa377a557f36c0d9f4d61d824901138513ce7969e3a1f8a736a2f9a1cd1b79","kind":"equation","label":"Equation 103","ref_key":"eq:REF103qq1","name":"","order":24,"deps":[],"cite_keys":[],"provenance":{"source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.00483","harvest_mode":"arxiv_eprint","payload_sha256":"4882ceeb764746d926f61f1a8c4b185570d3c2b0f6653cc8df19cb8bbd4b8de4","line":1268,"origin":"latex_env:equation","retrieved_at":"2026-09-29T14:21:32+08:00"},"wash":{"version":"cardwash.v3","stages":["segment","purify","classify","dedupe","emit"],"numbering":"document_order_with_label_heuristic","detail":{"stripped_proof":false,"chars":677,"math_hints":88}}},"paper":{"source_id":"arXiv:2402.00483","title":"Gelfand-Tsetlin modules for Lie algebras of rank $2$","abstract":"We explicitly construct families of simple modules for Lie algebras of rank $2$, on which certain commutative subalgebra acts diagonally and has a simple spectrum. In type $A$ these modules are well known generic Gelfand-Tsetlin modules and they can be viewed as such for other rank $2$ Lie algebras.","authors":["Milica Anđelić","Carlos M. da Fonseca","Vyacheslav Futorny","Andrew Tsylke"],"year":"